team/apps/2494780/extras/bf15a4379c0d577e49acaaee1c28e7b1.mp4?t=1765281862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >#DRIVE Rally not only nails the spirit of the 90s. It reignites it for a new generation of drivers. Whether you're a veteran of dirt roads or a rookie just looking to get their tires wet, this game will let you redefine speed over and over again. <br><br><strong>#DRIVE Rally 1.0 Main Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Redefined Arcade Racing</strong> \u2013 easy to pick up, challenging to master.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local Party Mode</strong> \u2013 up to 12 players take turns racing for the top spot in leaderboard!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free Roam Mode with collectibles</strong> \u2013 explore and unlock interior decors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Global Leaderboards with saved Ghosts</strong> \u2013 chase records and race yourself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6 Passionate Co-Drivers with their own Championships</strong> \u2013 complete them and unlock more cars.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>25 Customizable Legendary Cars</strong> \u2013 each in 3 rally classes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 600 km of Rally Stages in 6 iconic locations</strong> \u2013 from snowy Finland to the deserts of the USA.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perfect shots with Photo Mode</strong> \u2013 capture your rally moments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controller and Wheel Support</strong> \u2013 including force feedback.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Deck Verified</strong> \u2013 play anywhere, anytime.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >#DRIVE World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2494780/extras/b372819f117eadc1c8ca1ab6a870e65a.poster.avif?t=1765281862\" width=617 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2494780/extras/b372819f117eadc1c8ca1ab6a870e65a.webm?t=1765281862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the sunny landscapes of Dry Crumbs, through the whispering woods of Holzberg, to the chilly wilderness of Revontuli. Take a journey to a diverse world you haven\u2019t experienced in racing games before.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Legendary Cars</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2494780/extras/4d802e0133de085ff9c7d1a55167afc6.poster.avif?t=1765281862\" width=617 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2494780/extras/4d802e0133de085ff9c7d1a55167afc6.webm?t=1765281862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump behind the wheel of legendary rally cars, including Das Holzwagen, The Doggo, The Bobond, and many more. We\u2019re going 90s this time, so there\u2019s also going to be new stuff. Das Sandsturm and Celestia just for a start!<br> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Passionate Co-Drivers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2494780/extras/dc066f18dc0ae69c08fe37690b6033c3.poster.avif?t=1765281862\" width=617 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2494780/extras/dc066f18dc0ae69c08fe37690b6033c3.webm?t=1765281862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_para